{"'Arrays must have the same length'":"E0","`HTTP ${response.status}`":"E1","'No response body to stream'":"E2","'string notation required for auto precision.'":"E3","\"numberOfChars must be strictly positive\"":"E4","INPUT_ERROR":"E5","FINALIZE_ERROR":"E6","ed[0]":"E7","msg || ec[ind]":"E8","'Invalid mode: ' + mode":"E9","'Invalid version: ' + version":"E10","'Invalid mode'":"E11","'Param is not a string'":"E12","'Unknown mode: ' + string":"E13","'Invalid data'":"E14","'The amount of data is too big to be stored in a QR Code'":"E15","'\\n' +\n      'The chosen QR Code version cannot contain this amount of data.\\n' +\n      'Minimum version required to store current data is: ' + bestVersion + '.\\n'":"E16","'No input text'":"E17","'Encoder not initialized'":"E18","'\"' + data + '\"' +\n      ' cannot be encoded with mode ' + Mode.toString(mode) +\n      '.\\n Suggested mode is: ' + Mode.toString(bestMode)":"E19","'\"version\" cannot be null or undefined'":"E20","'\"version\" should be in range from 1 to 40'":"E21","'\"toSJISFunc\" is not a valid function.'":"E22","'Invalid QR Code version'":"E23","message.error":"E24","'Invalid JSON response from server'":"E25","'The provider is not valid.'":"E26","'store timed out'":"E27","msg":"E28","'BitMatrix size must be defined and greater than 0'":"E29","'Unknown EC Level: ' + string":"E30","'log(' + n + ')'":"E31","'Invalid SJIS character: ' + this.data[i] + '\\n' +\n        'Make sure your charset is UTF-8'":"E32","'bad maskPattern:' + maskPattern":"E33","\"Cannot find module '\"+o+\"'\"":"E34","'resolver must be a function'":"E35","'Cannot resolve promise with itself'":"E36","'must be an array'":"E37","\"Cannot call a class as a function\"":"E38","'Failed to get type for BinaryArray'":"E39","'Unkown type: ' + type":"E40","\"Can't call config() after localforage \" + 'has been used.'":"E41","'Database version must be a number.'":"E42","'Custom driver not compliant; see ' + 'https://mozilla.github.io/localForage/#definedriver'":"E43","'Method ' + methodName + ' is not implemented by the current driver'":"E44","'Driver not found.'":"E45","'No available storage method found.'":"E46"}